y ticket before opening the gate.","zh":"警卫检查了我的票才打开大门。","src":"词光 Word Atlas"},{"en":"Museums employ trained staff to guard valuable collections while ensuring that visitors can enjoy them safely.","zh":"博物馆雇用受过培训的工作人员保护珍贵藏品，同时确保游客能够安全地观赏。","src":"词光 Word Atlas"}],"senses":[{"pos":"n.","zh":"警卫；门卫","en":""}],"col":[],"fam":[],"syn":[],"ant":[],"tip":"","cefr":"Unit 5","topic":"key","page":75,"key":true,"unit":"unit-5"},{"id":"fltrp9a-foreigner","w":"foreigner","uk":"/ˈfɒrənə/","m":15,"us":"/ˈfɔːrənər/","ex":[{"en":"As a foreigner, I needed help understanding local customs.","zh":"作为外国人，我需要别人帮助我了解当地习俗。","src":"词光 Word Atlas"},{"en":"Language courses can help foreigners participate more fully in community life and access essential public services.","zh":"语言课程可以帮助外国人更充分地参与社区生活，并获得必要的公共服务。","src":"词光 Word Atlas"}],"senses":[{"pos":"n.","zh":"外国人","en":""}],"col":[],"fam":[],"syn":[],"ant":[],"tip":"","cefr":"Unit 5","topic":"key","page":76,"key":true,"unit":"unit-5"},{"id":"fltrp9a-logo","w":"logo","uk":"/ˈləʊɡəʊ/","m":15,"us":"/ˈloʊɡoʊ/","ex":[{"en":"The bakery uses a wheat stalk as its logo.","zh":"这家面包店用一支麦穗作为徽标。","src":"词光 Word Atlas"},{"en":"A distinctive logo helps consumers recognise a company, but product quality is essential for building lasting trust.","zh":"独特的徽标帮助消费者识别企业，但产品质量才是建立持久信任的关键。","src":"词光 Word Atlas"}],"senses":[{"pos":"n.","zh":"标识，标志，徽标","en":""}],"col":[],"fam":[],"syn":[],"ant":[],"tip":"","cefr":"Unit 5","topic":"basic","page":76,"key":false,"unit":"unit-5"},{"id":"fltrp9a-endangered","w":"endangered","uk":"/ɪnˈdeɪndʒəd/","m":2,"us":"","ex":[],"senses":[{"pos":"adj.","zh":"濒危的，濒临灭绝的","en":""}],"col":[],"fam":[],"syn":[],"ant":[],"tip":"","cefr":"Unit 5","topic":"basic","page":76,"key":false,"unit":"unit-5"},{"id":"fltrp9a-vulnerable","w":"vulnerable","uk":"/ˈvʌlnərəbəl/","m":2,"us":"","ex":[],"senses":[{"pos":"adj.","zh":"易受伤的","en":""}],"col":[],"fam":[],"syn":[],"ant":[],"tip":"","cefr":"Unit 5","topic":"basic","page":76,"key":false,"unit"